 4\n\nBoston’s best return to the 'House! Improv comedians are ready to k
 eep you laughing with spontaneous sketches\, quick wit\, and audience-insp
 ired moments. Join us for a cocktail from the cash bar beginning at 7:30pm
 \, then snag your seat and enjoy a show packed with energy from beginning 
 to end. Seating is first come\, first serve\n\nMake it a night with a pre-
 show burger and a beer from the Pub. Dining walk-ins are welcome! \n\n*Thi
 s event complimentary and available for registered members and up to one r
 egistered guest.
